## 📖 About This Course

A free, 8-week, hands-on workforce development course preparing adult learners and out-of-school youth in Eastern North Carolina to pass the **CompTIA Linux+ (XK0-005)** exam and land their first IT job.

This course is built and instructed by **Kelvin R. Tobias**, a former diesel mechanic turned AI Engineer, in partnership with **Lenoir Community College** and funded through state workforce development pathways.

Our goal is simple: in 8 weeks, take a student from never having opened a terminal to walking into a Linux job interview with confidence.

