## 🐧 Why Both Ubuntu AND Rocky Linux?

Most Linux courses teach you one distribution. We teach you both halves of the Linux world.

- **Ubuntu** runs the cloud — AWS, Google Cloud, most modern web servers
- **Red Hat / Rocky** runs the enterprise — government, healthcare, banks, defense

By Week 8, you can walk into any IT shop in America and speak their language. The CompTIA Linux+ exam tests both, so we teach both.

